# Suggest commit message

After code/doc changes (unless user asked to commit / said not to): check `git status` + `git log -5 --oneline`, then suggest one short message for **pending** changes only—do not commit.

Use **scoped** conventional commits: `type(scope): summary` (e.g. `feat(wifi): …`, `fix(i2c): …`, `docs(readme): …`). Match recent `git log` for type/scope wording; common types: `feat` / `fix` / `refactor` / `docs` / `build`.
